以其惡似張布，追改定名爲布。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":72,"last_line":72,"raw_start":11934,"raw_end":12433,"raw_character_offsets":[11946,11947,11948,11949,11957,11958,11959,11960,11961,11962,11963,11964,11965,11966,11967,11968,11969,11970,11971,11972,11973,11974,11975,11976,11977,11978,11979,11980,11981,11982,11983,11984,11985,11986,11987,11988,11989,11990,11991,11992,11993,11994,11995,11996,11997,11998,11999,12000,12001,12002,12003,12004,12005,12006,12007,12008,12009,12010,12011,12012,12013,12014,12015,12016,12017,12018,12019,12020,12021,12022,12023,12024,12025,12026,12027,12160,12161,12162,12163,12164,12165,12166,12167,12168,12169,12170,12171,12172,12173,12174,12175,12176,12177,12178,12179,12180,12181,12182,12183,12184],"revision_id":2085142},"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p023:m0012","surface":"步闡","start":12,"end":14,"kind":"person","person_id":"ef9_cad_60f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p023:m0015","surface":"闡","start":15,"end":16,"kind":"person","person_id":"ef9_cad_60f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p023:m0033","surface":"闡","start":33,"end":34,"kind":"person","person_id":"ef9_cad_60f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p023:m0035","surface":"闡","start":35,"end":36,"kind":"person","person_id":"ef9_cad_60f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p023:m0040","surface":"闡","start":40,"end":41,"kind":"person","person_id":"ef9_cad_60f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p023:m0060","surface":"萬彧","start":60,"end":62,"kind":"person","person_id":"bmy_4x8_vlh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p023:m0075","surface":"何定","start":75,"end":77,"kind":"person","person_id":"h6n_ozv_ytl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p023:m0090","surface":"張布","start":90,"end":92,"kind":"person","person_id":"vzp_xqn_w3p","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-048","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao-ws2085142"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044","text":"　　孫匡字季佐，翊弟也。舉孝廉茂才，未試用，卒。時年二十餘。子泰，曹氏之甥也，為長水校尉。嘉禾三年，從權圍新城，中流矢死。泰子秀為前將軍、夏口督。秀公室至親，握兵在外，皓意不能平。建衡二年，皓遣何定將五千人至夏口獵。先是，民間歛言秀當見圖，而定遠獵，秀遂驚，夜將妻子親兵數百人奔晉。晉以秀為驃騎將軍、儀同三司，封會稽公。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"孫匡","kind":"person","person_id":"icr_lwq_9mp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"季佐","kind":"person","person_id":"icr_lwq_9mp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044:m0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"翊","kind":"person","person_id":"iyi_e4b_ig6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044:m0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"泰","kind":"person","person_id":"icr_lwq_9mp_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044:m0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044:m0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"泰","kind":"person","person_id":"icr_lwq_9mp_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044:m0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"秀","kind":"person","person_id":"icr_lwq_9mp_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-kuang:line044:m0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"秀","kind":"person","person_id":"icr_lwq_9mp_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id"